        "custom_liquid_yR4UPX": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .yc-desc { margin: 28px 0 0; }\n  .yc-desc__heading { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #233923; margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .yc-desc__text { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #233923; margin: 0; }\n  .yap-trust-bar { width: 100%; margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: inherit; }\n  .yap-trust-item { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 58px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .yap-trust-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .yap-trust-icon { width: 28px; min-width: 28px; margin-right: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #6b6b6b; }\n  .yap-trust-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; stroke: currentColor; fill: none; stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }\n  .yap-trust-text { flex: 1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.15px; color: #232739; }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) { .yap-trust-item { min-height: 54px; padding: 9px 2px; } .yap-trust-text { font-size: 14px; } .yap-trust-icon { width: 26px; min-width: 26px; margin-right: 9px; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"yc-desc\">\n  <h2 class=\"yc-desc__heading\">The Autonomous Base for Every Season</h2>\n  <p class=\"yc-desc__text\">The Yarbo Core is the autonomous, all-terrain base at the center of an entire yard care system, built to run your property without you standing over it. RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion map your land to centimeter accuracy and hold a precise line even under tree cover, where GPS-only robots lose their way. A tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and rough terrain that stop wheeled machines outright, and it can tow up to 500 lbs for daily tasks or 3,500 lbs of rolling weight. On its own, the Core is the foundation, add the Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, or Leaf Blower module and it becomes a season-specific machine, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes. Every Core ships from U.S. warehouses and is covered by Yarbo's 2-year manufacturer warranty, backed by direct support from Yard Automation Pros before and after the sale.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yap-trust-bar\">\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 19 6v5c0 4.8-2.9 8.2-7 10-4.1-1.8-7-5.2-7-10V6l7-3z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">Price Match Available on Request | Returns Per Manufacturer Policy</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.5 6.5a4 4 0 0 0-5.2 5.2L4 17l3 3 5.3-5.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.2-5.2l-2.2 2.2-2.8-2.8 2-2.4z\"/><path d=\"M16 4h4\"/><path d=\"M18 2v4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">2-Year Manufacturer Warranty | US-Based Email Support</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h11v11H3z\"/><path d=\"M14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">10–14 Business Day Estimated Delivery</div></div>\n  <div class=\"yap-trust-item\"><div class=\"yap-trust-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/><path d=\"M12 14v3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"yap-trust-text\">Secure Checkout | Protected Payment</div></div>\n</div>"
          },
          "disabled": true
        },
        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Core is a modular robotic yard automation platform designed for residential and commercial use. Powered by AI navigation and RTK GPS precision, it handles lawn mowing, snow blowing, and more, all from a single app. Quiet, efficient, and built to handle complex yard layouts with ease.<br/><br/>One machine. Every season. The Yarbo Core is the tracked, all-terrain base at the center of the entire Yarbo system. Add a module and it becomes a mower, a snow blower, or a leaf blower, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes.<br/><br/>🎯 No boundary wires. RTK GPS maps your property to centimeter accuracy.<br/>⛰️ Handles slopes up to 70% (35°), where wheeled robots fail.<br/>🔄 Modular by design. One base, multiple attachments, every season covered.<br/></p>"
          },
          "disabled": true
        },
        "custom_liquid_ycProdInfo": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<details class=\"collapsible-tab\">\n  <summary class=\"collapsible-tab__heading\">\n    <span>Product Information</span>\n    {% render 'icon-chevron-down-small' %}\n  </summary>\n  <div class=\"collapsible-tab__text\">\n    <p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>One machine. Every season.</strong></p><p>The Yarbo Core is the tracked, all-terrain base at the center of the entire Yarbo system. On its own, it’s the foundation. Add a module, and it becomes a mower, a snow blower, or a leaf blower, then swaps back in minutes when the season changes.</p><p><strong>Requires a module to run.</strong> The Core alone doesn’t mow, blow, or clear anything. If you don’t already own modules, a bundle like the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> includes the Core and gets you running immediately.</p><h3>Precision navigation, no boundary wires</h3><p>RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion map your property to centimeter accuracy and hold precise lines even under tree cover, where GPS-only robots drift.</p><h3>Built for real terrain</h3><p>A tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and rough ground that stop wheeled robots. Tow up to 500 lbs for daily tasks, or up to 3,500 lbs of rolling weight.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Ships from U.S. warehouses.</strong> Typically 10 to 14 days after your order.</li><li><strong>Covered by Yarbo’s 2 year manufacturer warranty</strong> on defective parts, excluding consumables, from your activation date.</li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>\n    {% assign yc_related = collections['yarbo'].products %}\n    {% if yc_related.size > 0 %}\n      <style>\n        .yc-upsell { margin-top: 32px; }\n        .yc-upsell__heading { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #233923; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; margin: 0 0 16px; }\n        .yc-upsell__track { display: flex; gap: 24px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x proximity; padding: 4px 4px 16px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }\n        .yc-upsell__card { flex: 0 0 220px; scroll-snap-align: start; border: 1px solid #d7ddd4; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; transition: box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }\n        .yc-upsell__card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(35,57,35,.14); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n        .yc-upsell__img-link { display: block; text-decoration: none; }\n        .yc-upsell__img-wrap { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; background: #f2f4f1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .yc-upsell__img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }\n        .yc-upsell__title-link { text-decoration: none; }\n        .yc-upsell__title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #233923; margin: 12px 14px 4px; line-height: 1.3; }\n        .yc-upsell__price { font-size: 13.5px; color: #233923; margin: 0 14px 12px; opacity: .8; }\n        .yc-upsell__add { display: block; width: calc(100% - 28px); margin: 0 14px 14px; padding: 9px 0; background: #233923; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .3px; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s ease; }\n        .yc-upsell__add:hover { background: #152616; }\n        .yc-upsell__add[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: default; }\n      </style>\n      <div class=\"yc-upsell\">\n        <p class=\"yc-upsell__heading\">Pairs Well With</p>\n        <div class=\"yc-upsell__track\">\n          {% for p in yc_related limit: 8 %}\n            {% unless p.id == product.id %}\n              {% assign yc_variant = p.selected_or_first_available_variant %}\n              <div class=\"yc-upsell__card\">\n                <a class=\"yc-upsell__img-link\" href=\"{{ p.url }}\">\n                  <div class=\"yc-upsell__img-wrap\">\n                    {% if p.featured_image %}\n                      <img src=\"{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}\" alt=\"{{ p.featured_image.alt | default: p.title | escape }}\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\">\n                    {% endif %}\n                  </div>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"yc-upsell__title-link\" href=\"{{ p.url }}\"><p class=\"yc-upsell__title\">{{ p.title }}</p></a>\n                <p class=\"yc-upsell__price\">{{ p.price | money }}</p>\n                {% if yc_variant %}\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"yc-upsell__add\" data-variant-id=\"{{ yc_variant.id }}\">Add to Cart</button>\n                {% else %}\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"yc-upsell__add\" disabled>Sold Out</button>\n                {% endif %}\n              </div>\n            {% endunless %}\n          {% endfor %}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <script>\n        (function () {\n          document.querySelectorAll('.yc-upsell__add[data-variant-id]').forEach(function (btn) {\n            btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n              var variantId = btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');\n              btn.disabled = true;\n              var original = btn.textContent;\n              btn.textContent = 'Adding...';\n              fetch('/cart/add.js', {\n                method: 'POST',\n                headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n                body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: variantId, quantity: 1 }] })\n              })\n                .then(function (res) { return res.ok ? res.json() : Promise.reject(res); })\n                .then(function () {\n                  btn.textContent = 'Added';\n                  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh'));\n                  setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = original; btn.disabled = false; }, 1800);\n                })\n                .catch(function () {\n                  btn.textContent = 'Try Again';\n                  btn.disabled = false;\n                });\n            });\n          });\n        })();\n      </script>\n    {% endif %}\n  </div>\n</details>"
          },
          "disabled": true
        },
