        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Navigation & Sensing</h3><ul><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM</li><li><strong>Obstacle avoidance:</strong> Binocular camera + ultrasonic radar + bumper</li></ul><h3>Terrain & Towing</h3><ul><li><strong>Climbing ability:</strong> 70% (35°)</li><li><strong>Towing capacity:</strong> 500 lbs daily, 3,500 lbs max rolling weight</li><li><strong>Water resistance:</strong> IPX5</li><li><strong>Operating temperature:</strong> -13°F to 113°F (-25°C to 45°C)</li></ul><h3>Connectivity & Compatibility</h3><ul><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow</li><li><strong>Compatible modules:</strong> Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, Blower, Trimmer</li></ul><h3>Warranty & Shipping</h3><ul><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Yarbo's standard 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, from activation date</li><li><strong>Ships from:</strong> U.S. warehouses, approximately 10-14 days after payment</li></ul><h3>What's in the Box</h3><ul><li>Yarbo Core (universal drive unit)</li><li>Data Center & Docking Station</li><li>Yarbo Battery</li></ul><p>Modules (Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, Blower, Trimmer) are sold separately or as part of a bundle.</p>"
          },
