        "b1": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Upgrade 1",
            "title": "More done per charge.",
            "text": "With the Lawn Mower Pro, the Y40P mows up to 0.3 acre per charge, 2 acres a day and 7 acres a week. With the Snow Blower it clears up to 7,000 ft² per charge. Fewer stops to recharge in the middle of a job.",
