          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Upgrade 2",
            "title": "Control on real terrain.",
            "text": "Slopes up to 70% (35°), drainage ditches, uneven ground and dense grass. The hub motors give smoother motion and faster acceleration and turning.",
