    "yap_faq": {
      "type": "yap-faq",
      "settings": {
        "y40p_only": true,
        "eyebrow": "Questions before you buy",
        "heading": "Yarbo Y40P, answered.",
        "intro": "<p>Still deciding? Call <a href=\"tel:+14239273776\">+1 423-927-3776</a>, 9am to 5pm EST, or <a href=\"/pages/schedule-your-professional-consultation\">book a free property assessment</a>.</p>"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is the difference between the Y40 and the Y40P?",
            "a": "<p>The Y40P uses gearbox-free dual hub motors, which make it faster and more efficient than the Y40. Top speed rises from 0.6 to 1.2 m/s, mowing per charge from 0.25 to 0.3 acre, and snow cleared per charge from 6,000 to 7,000 ft². The climb rating of 70% (35°) and the noise level of about 60 dB are the same on both.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Does the Y40P Core work on its own?",
            "a": "<p>No. The Core is the base: drive, battery and navigation. It needs a module to mow, blow or clear snow. Add the Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, Blower or Trimmer and the same Core does that job.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How much lawn can the Y40P mow?",
            "a": "<p>With the Lawn Mower Pro module, the Y40P mows up to 0.3 acre per charge, 2 acres per day and about 7 acres per week at two cuts a week. It mows for about 120 minutes per charge, then docks and recharges on its own.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How steep a slope can it handle?",
            "a": "<p>Up to 70% (35°) with the Lawn Mower Pro, Blower and Trimmer modules. With the Snow Blower module, Yarbo rates it for slopes up to 36% (20°).</p>"
          }
        },
        "b5": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How loud is the Y40P?",
            "a": "<p>About 60 dB, which Yarbo compares to normal conversation. That makes early morning or evening schedules practical for most households.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b6": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can it work in rain and cold?",
            "a": "<p>The Lawn Mower Pro is rated IPX6 and has rain detection. The Snow Blower, Blower and Trimmer are rated IPX5, and the Snow Blower and Trimmer operate from -13°F to 113°F.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b7": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do I need to bury a boundary wire?",
            "a": "<p>No. The Y40P uses RTK satellite positioning with vision, IMU and odometry, so you map your property in the app instead of digging in a wire.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b8": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will my existing Yarbo modules fit the Y40P?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Yarbo sells the Lawn Mower Pro, Snow Blower, Blower and Trimmer as Y Series modules and publishes figures for both cores on the same module, for example 6 acres a week on the Y40 and 7 acres on the Y40P with the Lawn Mower Pro. If you own an older module, call <a href=\"tel:+14239273776\">+1 423-927-3776</a> and we will check it against your exact model.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b9": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is the Yarbo Trimmer?",
            "a": "<p>The Trimmer is a module that edges along fences, walls and beds where the mower cannot reach. It connects to the Core through the Back Brace Mount, which comes in the Trimmer Package with a tow hitch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b10": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What support do I get after I buy?",
            "a": "<p>Every Y40P is covered by Yarbo's manufacturer warranty, and our team is at <a href=\"tel:+14239273776\">+1 423-927-3776</a>, 9am to 5pm EST, or <a href=\"mailto:Support@yardautomationpros.com\">Support@yardautomationpros.com</a>. We help with app setup, mapping and warranty claims with Yarbo.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "b1",
        "b2",
        "b3",
        "b4",
        "b5",
